able</strong> (pieces are shuffled <strong>randomly</strong> with each new playthrough). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hand-drawn</strong> graphics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to solve the <strong>puzzles</strong> and create <strong>slimes</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1550920?t=1770848372","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1550920?t=1770848372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/2fde1a761176f1477caa043d092c163f61e0e084/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770848372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/2fde1a761176f1477caa043d092c163f61e0e084/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770848372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rotate the hexagons to fit the pieces together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/400da8d66f32018c61acd35551fa29f9.poster.avif?t=1770848372\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/400da8d66f32018c61acd35551fa29f9.webm?t=1770848372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/400da8d66f32018c61acd35551fa29f9.mp4?t=1770848372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go through challenges. Create slimes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as